%U A399311 27614527195681784654,1517565313983509247746,83398295378455681335854,4583180450657341434237968,251870172552430611481366766,13841607265295268673222966274
%N A399311 Number of perfect matchings of the 7 X 2n grid graph embedded on the Klein bottle.
%C A399311 The characteristic polynomial x^8 - 71*x^7 + 952*x^6 - 3976*x^5 + 6384*x^4 - 3976*x^3 + 952*x^2 - 71*x + 1 is palindromic. Using y = x + 1/x, it reduces to y^4 - 71*y^3 + 948*y^2 - 3763*y + 4482, which does not factor over the rationals. The dominant root is approximately 54.8.
%H A399311 Jean Lauro Muller, <a href="/A399311/b399311.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..30</a>
%H A399311 Jean Lauro Muller, <a href="/A399311/a399311.py.txt">Python program for computing the sequence</a>
%H A399311 <a href="/index/Rec#order_08">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (71,-952,3976,-6384,3976,-952,71,-1).
%F A399311 a(n) = 71*a(n-1) - 952*a(n-2) + 3976*a(n-3) - 6384*a(n-4) + 3976*a(n-5) - 952*a(n-6) + 71*a(n-7) - a(n-8) for n >= 9.
%F A399311 G.f.: 2*x*(71 - 1904*x + 11928*x^2 - 25536*x^3 + 19880*x^4 - 5712*x^5 + 497*x^6 - 8*x^7)/(1 - 71*x + 952*x^2 - 3976*x^3 + 6384*x^4 - 3976*x^5 + 952*x^6 - 71*x^7 + x^8).
%e A399311 For n=1, the 7 X 2 grid on the Klein bottle has a(1) = 142 perfect matchings (multigraph convention).
